# SHA1 thumbprint(s) of the IBSurgeon code-signing certificate, one per line.
#
# make-release.ps1 -Stage finish accepts a signed exe only when its
# Authenticode signer has one of these thumbprints. Change this file only on
# purpose, in its own commit (new certificate, renewal). The same thumbprint
# is in fbagent scripts/authenticode.pin and goafts
# ops/hqbird2027/authenticode.pin.
#
# Get the thumbprint from a file signed with the token:
#   (Get-AuthenticodeSignature .\fbmcp-windows-amd64.exe).SignerCertificate.Thumbprint
#
# Empty: -Stage finish refuses every signed zip.
# TOO IBSURGEON SOFTWARE, GlobalSign GCC R45 CodeSigning CA 2020, valid until 2027-07-13 (pinned 2026-10-25).
